@@ -19,16 +20,18 @@ During development, run it with `node bin/subtrack.js <command>`.
 
 | Option | Commands | Meaning |
 |---|---|---|
-| `--every month\|year` | add | How often the plan charges you (default `month`). |
-| `--since YYYY-MM-DD` | add | Date of the first charge (default today). Later charges fall on the same day of the month, or the last day of a shorter month. |
+| `--every week\|month\|year` | add | How often the plan charges you (default `month`). Weekly plans charge every 7 days. |
+| `--since YYYY-MM-DD` | add | Date of the first charge (default today). Later charges fall on the same day of the month (or last day of a shorter month), or every 7 days for weekly plans. |
 | `--within <days>` | renewals | How far ahead to look (default 30). A charge today counts. |
 | `--today YYYY-MM-DD` | list, renewals, export | Pretend today is another date. |
 | `--file <path>` | all | Where your subscriptions are kept. Default: `$SUBTRACK_FILE`, else `./subscriptions.json`. |
 
 ## Money
 
-Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. The monthly cost of a yearly plan is its
-price divided by 12.
+Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. Monthly costs are calculated as:
+- Monthly plan: price per month
+- Yearly plan: price ÷ 12 per month
+- Weekly plan: price × 52 ÷ 12 per month (since 52 weeks per year)
 
